      "title": "Care without conditions, without reward",
      "description": "Care is an empty ritual to no one and has no measurable outcome to secure. It is one person accompanying another through the joys and sorrows of life, without conditions, without rewards, without calculation of self-interest. A gesture, a word or an act of help turns into relation. From the workshop \"The Revolt of Care: Anarchist Mutual Aid in the 21st Century\" at the 2026 International Workshops. A Radical Guide is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit that builds movement infrastructure, including a global directory of radical spaces, mutual aid programs, and educational resources for people doing liberation work around the world. The full day: https://www.radical-guide.com/anarchist-international-worksho",
